cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Lean Formalization of Arithmetic and Basic Physical Interfaces"
message: "Cite this proof library with the exact source revision and the relevant companion manuscript. Attribution terms are preserved in LICENSE."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Guo
    given-names: Jinku
    affiliation: "Northwestern Polytechnical University, Xi'an, China"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0000-6600-6171"
abstract: >-
  A Lean formalization of arithmetic and basic physical interfaces from
  minimal unbiased compositional change. The library develops the common
  Gaussian and spectral constructions, generated natural-number arithmetic,
  internal response structures, and the basic Hermitian determinant interface.
  Exact formal statements, comparison classes and manuscript mappings are
  recorded in the accompanying theorem index.
keywords:
  - Lean
  - formal proof
  - natural-number arithmetic
  - spectral geometry
  - minimal change
notes: "The original license and additional attribution requirements are preserved in LICENSE."
